  era: "1857\u20131859 \xB7 Section 21 \xB7 Revolt of 1857 \xB7 1857 \u2013 1859"
  title: Course of the revolt
  text: The British retook Delhi in September 1857 and Lucknow after a long siege. Rani Lakshmibai died fighting near Gwalior in June 1858. By 1859 the revolt had been suppressed with great severity.
